{"id": "q0530", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2258117728, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "描述数据存储的各种方法。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0530.wav", "input_sha256": "d3c9a18d8228694bfb13f92c0a870308de19457a769f2b28f54544da1257bed9", "input_samples": 37400, "input_s": 2.337, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.3497, "act": 0.9974, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "数据存储的方法有很多，主要有文件系统、数据库系统和云存储。文件系统是最基础的一种，比如我们常用的硬盘或者U盘，它们把数据以文件的形式存储在磁盘上，每个文件都有自己的名字和路径。数据库系统则更加结构化，适合存储关系型或非关系型的数据，常用的有关系数据库如MySQL或SQLite，还有NoSQL类型如MongoDB。云存储是把数据保存在远程服务器上，通过网络访问，像阿里云或腾讯云就是典型的例子。还有一些专门为大数据设计的技术，比如分布式文件系统HDFS，它能将大量数", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0530_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "a8d4c523f7d18ff2f5c8cd4d8ee295aa37233674338c144a7f58e0ab81bd6cc8", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.055, 1.099, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.058, 2.103, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.337, 2.397, 2.443, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.337, 3.397, 3.872, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.338, 4.396, 4.923, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.338, 5.393, 5.848, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.338, 6.396, 6.908, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.338, 7.396, 7.879, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.338, 8.392, 8.864, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.338, 9.392, 9.882, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.338, 10.396, 10.891, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.338, 